  <escalation>
    <trigger name="partial-omit-set-discovered" source="row A38 executor obligation + project CLAUDE.md §Human Escalation Triggers">If ANY of the three secret entries (`BFF-API-ClientSecret`, `ServiceBus-ConnectionString`, `AiSearch--AdminKey`) is discovered to have MULTIPLE upsert sites beyond `StaticKvSecretManifest.cs:74`, STOP + re-scope. An incomplete omit-set is worse than no change — a residual site keeps the sentinel-vs-omit fight going + falsely reports "migrated" in the run record. Emit escalation with exact site inventory + a proposed complete omit-set scope.</trigger>
    <trigger name="manifest-refactored-since-2026-08-25" source="verification obligation">If the manifest generator has been refactored since 2026-08-25 (last grep-verify), re-verify `FromBicepOutput` / `FromExistingKvSecret` / `FromRunParameter` classification for all three entries BEFORE editing. Do NOT assume prior grep results still hold.</trigger>
    <trigger name="h7-task-142-cannot-close-in-budget" source="A30 sentinel contract scope obligation">If the H7/task-142 half of A30 sentinel contract CANNOT be closed within the 4h scope (e.g. it modifies a substantially different handler surface, or requires cross-worktree coordination), escalate with a proposed A44.5 row in `notes/auth-v4-integration-draft-punch-rows.md` + `SendMessage` to `main` — do NOT silently skip.</trigger>
    <trigger name="dataverse-clientsecret-in-omit-set" source="§6.5 record 2026-08-25 + Q3 sunset 2026-11-23">If executor is tempted to omit `Dataverse-ClientSecret` alongside the three A38 targets (e.g. because it is a "client secret"), STOP. `Dataverse-ClientSecret` is Q3 Path A rollback copy until 2026-11-23. It STAYS unconditionally. Only the three A38 targets are omitted.</trigger>
    <trigger name="marker-in-credential-slot" source="§9.1 sentinel ruling">If executor is tempted to write a marker string ("MI-FIC", "SECRET_FREE", "REDACTED", etc.) INTO the KV secret slot instead of omitting the entry, STOP. §9.1 rules this out — sentinel resolution produces opaque `AADSTS7000215` at runtime. Marker MUST live outside the credential slot: KV resource tag OR `sprk_dataverseenvironment` state field.</trigger>
    <trigger name="fleet-consistency-detector-cannot-land-in-budget" source="remediation plan §5.3 + constraint">If the Model 2 missed-tag detector (T8-probe-shape or manifest-linter class) cannot land within the 4h budget, file a follow-up row in `notes/task-202-punch-list.md` + note in run report. Do NOT silently defer — silence is the anti-pattern §9.1 exists to prevent.</trigger>
    <trigger name="a23-clobber-guard-regressed" source="row A23 already-applied">If the edit accidentally removes `skip-if-absent` or `never-declared` semantics (or their tests), STOP + revert. A23 protects against exactly the class of clobber a naive omit could re-open.</trigger>
    <trigger name="claude-directory-write-required" source="root CLAUDE.md §3 Sub-Agent Write Boundary">If executor is a sub-agent and any `.claude/**` file (e.g. `.claude/constraints/provisioning.md`'s §6.5 EDIT package prong 1 rewrite) needs to be updated to match the omit-set contract, STOP + note as coord item for main session — do NOT attempt Edit/Write on `.claude/**` paths from a sub-agent.</trigger>
  </escalation>

